The theme definitions and theme schema are from Pi v1.5.0,
https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/tree/f9a26365568127461c47a07a37dcb42c140a3ac5
and are used under its MIT license in PI-LICENSE.

The default coding-assistant preamble, skill guidance and edit/write guidance
in src/resources.rs and src/main.rs are adapted from that same Pi release.

Native terminal-image capability detection follows Pi v1.5.0 terminal-image.ts.
The Rust renderer implements the documented Kitty and iTerm2 protocols.

Markdown heading, fenced code, quote and list presentation in src/ui/render.rs
follows Pi v1.5.0 Markdown rendering conventions.
Edit-diff word highlighting follows Pi v1.5.0 diff.ts presentation conventions.
Edit normalization and unchanged-line preservation in src/text_edit.rs follow
Pi v1.5.0 edit-diff.ts under the same MIT license.
